<zk xmlns:n="native">
	<label multiline="true">
		1. Each row below is a flex container too narrow for its badges.
		- Expected: every badge is at least as wide as its button, so no button overlaps its neighbour,
			and every indicator is centred on the button corner its placement names.
		- Bug: each badge shrank to its indicator (20px, 6px for a dot), so the buttons overlapped and the
			right-side indicators sat inside the button.
	</label>
	<n:div id="row" style="display:flex; width:240px; gap:8px; padding:24px">
		<badge id="tr" count="5" placement="top_right"><button label="Inbox"/></badge>
		<badge id="tl" count="5" placement="top_left"><button label="Inbox"/></badge>
		<badge id="br" count="5" placement="bottom_right"><button label="Inbox"/></badge>
		<badge id="bl" count="5" placement="bottom_left"><button label="Inbox"/></badge>
	</n:div>
	<n:div id="dots" style="display:flex; width:120px; gap:8px; padding:24px">
		<badge id="dtr" dot="true" placement="top_right"><button label="Feed"/></badge>
		<badge id="dtl" dot="true" placement="top_left"><button label="Feed"/></badge>
		<badge id="dbr" dot="true" placement="bottom_right"><button label="Feed"/></badge>
	</n:div>
</zk>
